{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.21,
   "end": 4.95,
   "text": "I just gave away the cleaner we use on a 10,000 square foot mansion for free."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.63,
   "end": 6.21,
   "text": "Here's why."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.07,
   "end": 12.71,
   "text": "An investor within the network that we help mention that their short-term rental cleaner has been dropping the ball lately."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.11,
   "end": 17.63,
   "text": "They've been showing up late, missing items, and it's starting to affect their guest stay."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.31,
   "end": 20.07,
   "text": "And so we handed them our cleaner."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.39,
   "end": 22.59,
   "text": "The same crew that does our best properties."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.19,
   "end": 29.11,
   "text": "Most agents and investors try to hide their top contractors, cleaners, HVAC technicians, plumbers,"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.11,
   "end": 30.63,
   "text": "and they really gate keep."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.31,
   "end": 32.99,
   "text": "We at Acaba Home do the opposite."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.71,
   "end": 39.19,
   "text": "Because we're in the field every day, building our portfolios and helping our clients build their portfolios,"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.61,
   "end": 42.05,
   "text": "we believe in an abundant mindset."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.55,
   "end": 47.91,
   "text": "And so when your portfolio grows, we grow together, and so we give the whole Rolodex to our clients."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.67,
   "end": 50.25,
   "text": "Is this something that you're looking for?"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.49,
   "end": 55.07,
   "text": "Do you want a whole Rolodex of contractors and not just a realtor to go and buy a house?"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.07,
   "end": 59.29,
   "text": "Click that link in the bio, schedule some time to meet, and let's build together."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.79,
   "end": 61.45,
   "text": "No gate keeping, just results."
  }
 ],
